loop_case of ["balanced", [4.0, 4.000000000001, 4.000000000002, 4.000000000003, 4.000000000004, 4.000000000005, 4.000000000004, 4.000000000003, 4.000000000002, 4.000000000001, 4.0], true]

EQUILIBRIUM_TREND_ALL_PASS is true
print of "EQUILIBRIUM_TREND_ALL_PASS"
